<title>INDONESIA: Mobile Selular Indonesia to sign 70 bln rph loan.</title>
<headline>Mobile Selular Indonesia to sign 70 bln rph loan.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1997-01-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>PT Mobile Selular Indonesia, a cellular phone company, will sign a 70 billion rupiah credit facility on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Lead arranger for the issue is PT Bank Umum Servitia and PT Makindo. $=2,372 rupiah</p>
<p>-- Jakarta newsroom +6221 384-6364</p>
</text>
